  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1325 Project: Role of Women&apos;s in the Peace Process</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to strengthen the role of women and encouraging active participation of women in peace and security building in Afghanistan in light of the United Nations Security Council Resolution 1325. This project promoted the active participation of women in the peace process, protection of women from women rights violation. The government partner agency for this project was the High Peace Council.</narrative>
  </description>
